  "description": {
    "en": "Luxilon 4G Soft is the more comfortable version of the 4G family, engineered to preserve the exceptional tension maintenance and control of standard 4G while providing a softer, more forgiving response. It is over 10% softer than 4G, yet still retains solid firmness, durability and precision. Strategically aligned molecular chains help minimize tension loss over time, while the Poly-Ether-Ether construction supports strength, flexibility and consistent performance even in demanding weather conditions.",

    "zh": "Luxilon 4G Soft 是 4G 系列中更加舒适的版本，在保留标准 4G 出色保磅、控制和稳定性的同时，提供更柔和、更宽容的击球反馈。官方表示其柔软度相比 4G 提升超过 10%，但依旧保持足够的扎实感、耐久性和精准度。特殊排列的分子链结构有助于降低长期张力损失，而 Poly-Ether-Ether 材料则兼顾强度、柔韧性和稳定表现，即使在雨水或高湿度环境下也能保持良好可打性。"
  },

